@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_bindings/[binding_uuid]
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamBindingController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "背景表演者\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_bindings/{binding_uuid}
API -> DB: lock/update persistent USER_STREAM_BINDING;\nauthorization change => generation++
API -> DB: immutable outbox event 每一个 typed task
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: topic_membership_policy_rebuild / read_counters /\nfolder_projection / delivery_snapshot_event\n每一个 task 有自己的 outbox_event_uuid
Worker -> Worker: topic scope: placement access;\nuser-stream/user-topic/user-folder: shared rows
Worker -> DB: conditional generation; stale task = no-op
Worker -> Projection: 访问主题 + 已准备的计数器
Worker -> Events: 连接/流动事件\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
note over API,Worker
  一个 fenced owner exact scope key; 其他 scopes 它们是平行的.
  Lease expiry, retry/backoff, DLQ 其他 reaper 必须.
end note
@enduml
